{"sections":{"main-article-banner":{"type":"main-article-banner","blocks":{"spacing":{"type":"spacing","settings":{"height":68,"height_mobile":0}},"title":{"type":"title","settings":{"title_size":"title-lg tracking-heading","show_tags":false,"show_date":false,"show_comments":false,"show_author":false}}},"block_order":["spacing","title"],"settings":{"transparent_header":true,"show_image":true,"image_height":"750px","content_position":"md:items-center md:justify-center","text_alignment":"left","image_height_mobile":"auto","content_position_mobile":"items-end justify-center","text_alignment_mobile":"left","color_text":"#ffffff","color_overlay":"#000000","overlay_opacity":40,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"divider":false,"full_width":true,"rounded":true,"enable_parallax":true,"parallax_direction":"vertical"}},"rich_text_N7iFyt":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_8x4GM4":{"type":"heading","disabled":true,"settings":{"heading":"Rich text","heading_size":"title-lg tracking-heading","heading_tag":"h2","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"text_KgiaiA":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>On September 22, the Earth pauses in rare symmetry.<br/></p><p>Day and night share equal hours. Light and dark find perfect balance.</p><p>Across cultures, the Equinox has always been a time of gathering—harvest feasts, rituals of gratitude, and celebrations of the cycles that sustain life. Today, we carry those traditions forward with food that honors balance: nourishing both people and planet.</p>","text_size":"subtext-md","text_max_size":32,"text_font":"body","secondary_color":false,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"button_iLeqiR":{"type":"button","disabled":true,"settings":{"button_label":"Button label","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","button_size":"md","button_external":false,"button_icon":true}}},"block_order":["heading_8x4GM4","text_KgiaiA","button_iLeqiR"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.presets.name","settings":{"custom-class":"","text_alignment":"left","text_alignment_mobile":"left","heading":"","heading_size":"title-md","heading_alignment":"text-left md:items-end md:flex-row","heading_width":"small","heading_tag":"h2","subheading":"","description":"","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":20,"divider":false,"narrow":true,"rounded":false}},"rich_text_nLLbyT":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_cRaJEi":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Balance for the body","heading_size":"title-lg tracking-heading","heading_tag":"h2","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"text_RP6eDR":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Seafood is nature’s blueprint for equilibrium. Rich in Omega-3s, vitamin D, selenium, and complete protein, it restores what modern diets so often lack.</p><p>At Seatopia, every harvest is tested for nutrient density and purity. Our <a href=\"/pages/why-clean-seafood-matters\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Why Clean Seafood Matters\">Seatopia Standard™ </a>sets stricter limits than the FDA:</p><ul><li>Mercury ≤0.1 ppm (10x stricter than FDA)</li><li>No detected microplastics above the testable limit</li><li>Parasite-safe, sushi-grade handling</li><li>Nutrient levels verified by third-party labs<br/></li></ul><p>It means our seafood is safe for everyone at the table—from children to expecting mothers—while offering therapeutic levels of nutrients that keep the body in balance</p>","text_size":"subtext-md","text_max_size":32,"text_font":"body","secondary_color":false,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"button_zfBbXg":{"type":"button","disabled":true,"settings":{"button_label":"Button label","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","button_size":"md","button_external":false,"button_icon":true}}},"block_order":["heading_cRaJEi","text_RP6eDR","button_zfBbXg"],"name":"Balance for the body","settings":{"custom-class":"","text_alignment":"left","text_alignment_mobile":"left","heading":"","heading_size":"title-md","heading_alignment":"text-left md:items-end md:flex-row","heading_width":"small","heading_tag":"h2","subheading":"","description":"","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":20,"divider":false,"narrow":true,"rounded":false}},"rich_text_nPKtKy":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_Rdejqb":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Balance for the Ocean","heading_size":"title-lg tracking-heading","heading_tag":"h2","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"text_VGhAhg":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Most seafood today is taken faster than it can return, leaving oceans depleted. Seatopia is building a different future: regenerative aquaculture that restores ecosystems, supports coastal communities, and redefines what a harvest can be.<br/><br/>When you gather around Seatopia seafood, you’re not only nourishing your family—you’re helping restore balance to the blue planet we depend on.</p>","text_size":"subtext-md","text_max_size":32,"text_font":"body","secondary_color":false,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"button_gC7Cwd":{"type":"button","disabled":true,"settings":{"button_label":"Button label","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","button_size":"md","button_external":false,"button_icon":true}}},"block_order":["heading_Rdejqb","text_VGhAhg","button_gC7Cwd"],"name":"Balance for the ocean","settings":{"custo